OL,3,AUK joins in GTA 6 frenzy as game       
OL,4,Abecomes available worldwide            
OL,6,FNintendo's The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina
OL,7,Fof Time has held the top spot since    
OL,8,F1998 - but Metacritic confirmed to the 
OL,9,FBBC that this has now officially been  
OL,10,Fovertaken.                             
OL,12,FGTA 6 is set to become one of the      
OL,13,Fworld's most popular entertainment     
OL,14,Fproducts ever, with fans booking time  
OL,15,Foff work, and schools warning students 
OL,16,Fnot to bunk off.                       
